              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us:</th></tr><tr><td>The patient shows moderately reduced kidney function (GFR 36 mL/min/1.73 m²), consistent with stage 3b chronic kidney disease. This finding warrants monitoring of renal function, review of medications for nephrotoxicity, and assessment for complications such as anemia, electrolyte disturbances, and fluid balance. Clinical correlation and further evaluation are recommended.</td></tr></table></div>"
